  "content": "<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stellaris-stellarview-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1482048?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&color=626e7b&label=CurseForge\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a>\n[![GitHub](https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-grey?style=for-the-badge&logo=github)](https://github.com/lukaskabc/Stellaris-StellarView-Compatibility)\n[![Версия resourcepack на Modrinth](https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/g8L9U4Pb?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&color=626e7b&label=Resourcepack%20version)](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/stellaris-stellarview-compatibility-resourcepack)\n\n\nОтключает пользовательское небо из Stellaris и настраивает небо StellarView для каждой планеты.\n\nСуществует два формата совместимости: мод или resourcepack.\nОни идентичны, но в формате мода вы получаете автоматическую проверку зависимостей от neoforge.\n\n## Зависимости\n\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>StellarView Mixin Renderer</td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/lukaskabc/StellarViewMixinRenderer/\">\n          <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-grey?style=for-the-badge&logo=GitHub\" alt=\"GitHub\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/stellar-view-mixin-renderer\">\n          <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-grey?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stellar-view-mixin-renderer\">\n          <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-grey?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Stellaris</td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/st0x0ef/stellaris/\">\n          <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-grey?style=for-the-badge&logo=GitHub\" alt=\"GitHub\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/stellaris\">\n          <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-grey?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stellaris\">\n          <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-grey?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>StellarView</td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/Povstalec/stellarview/\">\n          <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-grey?style=for-the-badge&logo=GitHub\" alt=\"GitHub\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/stellarview\">\n          <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-grey?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stellarview\">\n          <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-grey?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n## Реализованные планеты/измерения\n\n- Земля (верхний мир)\n- Орбита Земли\n- Юпитер\n- Марс\n- Орбита Марса\n- Меркурий\n- Орбита Меркурия\n- Луна\n- Венера\n- Орбита Венеры",
